ation in agriculture","why":"Shoffner targets monopolies in seed, fertilizer and meatpacking that she says squeeze Arkansas growers.","src":"https://prospect.org/2026/10/08/prairie-populist-crimson-red-arkansas-hallie-shoffner/"},{"issue":"Data centers and utility rates","why":"Shoffner raised concerns about data centers driving up power use and utility bills.","src":"https://talkbusiness.net/2026/10/shoffner-wadlin-hold-senate-debate-cotton-a-no-show/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"October poll shows Cotton up nine","date":"2026-10-16","what":"A Talk Business and Hendrix College poll had Cotton at 50 percent, Shoffner at 41 and Libertarian Jeff Wadlin at 5.","helps":"R","kind":"local","src":"https://politicalwire.com/2026/10/16/tom-cotton-leads-comfortably-in-arkansas/"},{"title":"No Cotton Shoffner debate","date":"2026-10-14","what":"Salem Media withdrew its offer to host the only debate Cotton accepted, and Shoffner said Cotton is either too good or too scared to face her.","helps":"D","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.newsfromthestates.com/article/debate-arkansas-us-senate-race-wont-take-place-cotton-and-shoffner-campaigns-say"},{"title":"Cotton skips Arkansas TV debate","date":"2026-10-12","what":"Shoffner and Wadlin debated in Conway without Cotton, with Shoffner tying him to the Iran war and votes against past farm bills.","helps":"D","kind":"debate","src":"https://talkbusiness.net/2026/10/shoffner-wadlin-hold-senate-debate-cotton-a-no-show/"},{"title":"Shoffner ad features former Cotton voter","date":"2026-10-08","what":"A Shoffner ad features a former Cotton voter criticizing him for voting down the farm bill twice.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://prospect.org/2026/10/08/prairie-populist-crimson-red-arkansas-hallie-shoffner/"},{"title":"Cotton outspending Shoffner 65 to 1","date":"2026-09-29","what":"Cotton and allies had spent about 13.6 million dollars on ads to roughly 209,000 for Shoffner, with no national Democratic money in the race.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://newsweek.com/gops-tom-cotton-outspending-dem-rival-65-1-in-state-trump-won-by-31-points-12503483"},{"title":"Shoffner shifts on ICE","date":"2026-09-03","what":"After Cotton ads used her June pledge to defund ICE, Shoffner wrote that she does not want to defund ICE but reform it.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/dem-senate-nominee-changes-tune-ice-after-vowing-not-one-more-dime-agency"},{"title":"August poll shows Shoffner ahead","date":"2026-08-19","what":"A Talk Business and Hendrix poll had Shoffner at 47 percent and Cotton at 44, within the margin of error.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://talkbusiness.net/?p=300296"}],"events":[{"title":"Defund ICE clip","prompt":"Attack ads are replaying a recorded pledge to defund ICE as it exists today, and early voting has begun. How do you handle immigration enforcement?","issue":"immig","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/dem-senate-nominee-changes-tune-ice-after-vowing-not-one-more-dime-agency","opts":[{"label":"Stand by defunding","say":"Say ICE as it exists is abusive and should not get another dime.","pos":-0.9,"trump":-0.9,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Reform, not defund","say":"Back deporting violent criminals while requiring visible badges and no masks for agents.","pos":-0.2,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Fund full enforcement","say":"Promise more money for ICE and back the president's deportation push.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.9,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Farm bill and tariffs","prompt":"Arkansas leads the nation in farm bankruptcies, there is no new farm bill, and tariffs and fuel prices are squeezing growers. What is your answer?","issue":"econ","src":"https://talkbusiness.net/2026/10/shoffner-wadlin-hold-senate-debate-cotton-a-no-show/","opts":[{"label":"End blanket tariffs","say":"Oppose blanket tariffs, pass a farm bill and break up agriculture monopolies.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.8,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Targeted aid and tariffs"